          <div class="ig-eyebrow"><span class="ig-eyebrow__ln"></span>Step-by-Step Guide</div>
          <h1 class="ig-hero__title">Installing Your <span class="ig-i">iMosaicArt</span> Masterpiece</h1>
          <p class="ig-hero__sub">Turn any space into a stunning work of art. This beginner-friendly guide walks you through every step — from prep to polish — for a flawless, professional finish.</p>
          <p class="ig-hero__note">No prior experience needed — your walls and floors are the canvas, and every tile a brushstroke.</p>
